    "sections": [
        {
            "id": "block_752dc716eb48d2f18b2d877ec8f9d45d",
            "type": "heroTBM",
            "modifiers": ["animated-hero"],
            "eyebrow": "Bryntum Task Board",
            "heading": "A Super Flexible Kanban Board Component",
            "body_html": "<p>Visualize and manage your work with the Bryntum Task Board. Built using modern JavaScript, our Kanban component easily integrates with <a href=\"https://bryntum.com/products/react-task-board/\">React</a>, <a href=\"https://bryntum.com/products/angular-task-board/\">Angular</a>, and <a href=\"https://bryntum.com/products/vue-task-board/\">Vue</a> applications.</p>",
            "body_text": "Visualize and manage your work with the Bryntum Task Board. Built using modern JavaScript, our Kanban component easily integrates with React , Angular , and Vue applications.",
            "ctas": [
                {
                    "text": "View Examples",
                    "href": "/products/taskboard/examples",
                    "title": "View Examples"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Download Trial",
                    "href": "/download/?product=taskboard",
                    "title": "Download Trial"
                }
            ],
            "media": [
                {
                    "kind": "svg-file", "src": "heroes/taskboard.svg"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "block_agbryntum_partnership",
            "type": "partnership",
            "heading": "Your JavaScript toolkit just got bigger",
            "body_html": "<p>Following our 2025 <a href=\"https://blog.ag-grid.com/ag-grid-and-bryntum-join-forces-to-strengthen-developer-tooling-for-modern-web-applications/\">partnership with Bryntum</a>, the components you trust for data now sit alongside the best tools for scheduling and project planning.</p><p>You already trust AG Grid for your data, Bryntum Task Board brings that same standard to kanban-style task workflows — built by the same kind of team, to the same standard.</p>",
            "body_text": "Following our 2025 partnership with Bryntum, the components you trust for data now sit alongside the best tools for scheduling and project planning. You already trust AG Grid for your data, Bryntum Task Board brings that same standard to kanban-style task workflows — built by the same kind of team, to the same standard.",
            "logo_light_src": "/images/campaigns/bryntum-products/shared/ag-grid-x-bryntum-light.svg",
            "logo_dark_src": "/images/campaigns/bryntum-products/shared/ag-grid-x-bryntum-dark.svg",
            "logo_alt": "AG Grid x Bryntum partnership"
        },
        {
            "id": "block_agbryntum_intro_video_taskboard",
            "type": "intro-video",
            "video_src": "https://www.youtube.com/embed/HqyiViksBQU?feature=oembed",
            "title": "Bryntum Task Board Intro"
        },
        {
            "id": "block_a2016e10d3e520694a7ca1d3ffe417d9",
            "type": "text-media",
            "modifiers": ["image", "reverse", "added-shadow"],
            "heading": "Get All the Right Features",
            "body_html": "<p>The Bryntum Task Board includes a set of optional features thoughtfully designed to fit your workflow:</p> <ul> <li>Customize the rendering and styling of cards, columns and swimlanes.</li> <li>Toggle features on or off at runtime via a flexible API.</li> <li>Scroll smoothly through <a href=\"/products/taskboard/examples/bigdataset/\">massive data sets</a>.</li> </ul>",
            "body_text": "The Bryntum Task Board includes a set of optional features thoughtfully designed to fit your workflow: Customize the rendering and styling of cards, columns and swimlanes. Toggle features on or off at runtime via a flexible API. Scroll smoothly through massive data sets .",
            "links": [
                {
                    "text": "Get All the Right Features",
                    "href": "/products/taskboard/examples/config-panel"
                },
                {
                    "text": "massive data sets",
                    "href": "/products/taskboard/examples/bigdataset/"
                }
            ],
            "ctas": [
                {
                    "text": "Try demo",
                    "href": "/products/taskboard/examples/config-panel",
                    "title": "Try demo"
                }
            ],
            "media": [
                {
                    "kind": "image",
                    "src": "../assets/taskboard/taskboard-config-panel-svalbard-scaled.png",
                    "alt": "",
                    "width": "1240",
                    "height": "864",
                    "src_original": "https://bryntum.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/taskboard-config-panel-svalbard-scaled.png"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "block_c57f051d24cd8095d56be8d6b7b4e1d6",
            "type": "text-media",
            "modifiers": ["video-file", "added-shadow"],
            "heading": "Organize Tasks Into Swimlanes and Columns",
            "body_html": "<p>Part of a busy team? Stay on top of tasks with ease by tailoring your Task Board with <a href=\"/products/taskboard/examples/swimlanes/\">swimlanes</a> and any number of columns.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"/products/taskboard/examples/locked-column/\">Lock an important column</a> in place for quick access.</li> <li>Hide less important tasks by collapsing swimlanes and columns.</li> <li><a href=\"/products/taskboard/examples/filtering/\">Filter</a> and <a href=\"/products/taskboard/examples/sorting/\">sort</a> tasks to focus on your highest priorities.</li> </ul>",
            "body_text": "Part of a busy team? Stay on top of tasks with ease by tailoring your Task Board with swimlanes and any number of columns. Lock an important column in place for quick access. Hide less important tasks by collapsing swimlanes and columns. Filter and sort tasks to focus on your highest priorities.",
            "links": [
                {
                    "text": "Organize Tasks Into Swimlanes and Columns",
                    "href": "/products/taskboard/examples/swimlanes-content/"
                },
                {
                    "text": "swimlanes",
                    "href": "/products/taskboard/examples/swimlanes/"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Lock an important column",
                    "href": "/products/taskboard/examples/locked-column/"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Filter",
                    "href": "/products/taskboard/examples/filtering/"
                },
                {
                    "text": "sort",
                    "href": "/products/taskboard/examples/sorting/"
                }
            ],
            "ctas": [
                {
                    "text": "Try demo",
                    "href": "/products/taskboard/examples/locked-column/",
                    "title": "Try demo"
                }
            ],
            "media": [
                {
                    "kind": "video",
                    "src": "../assets/taskboard/taskboard-locked-column.mp4",
                    "src_original": "https://bryntum.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/taskboard-locked-column.mp4"
                }
