        {
            "id": "block_0284d081fe88dec979b28b8edc99b607",
            "type": "text-media",
            "modifiers": ["image", "added-shadow"],
            "heading": "Benefit From Instantly Familiar UX",
            "body_html": "<p class=\"p1\">Reduce your users’ admin load with the Task Board’s inviting and intuitive interactions:</p> <ul> <li>Verify changes with <a href=\"/products/taskboard/examples/task-drag/\">confirmation dialogs</a></li> <li><a href=\"/products/taskboard/examples/scrolling/\">Auto-scroll to any swimlane or column</a> for easy navigation.</li> <li>Edit tasks directly with <a href=\"/products/taskboard/examples/simple-task-edit/\">inline editing</a>, or use the <a href=\"/products/taskboard/examples/task-edit/\">task editor</a> and <a href=\"/products/taskboard/examples/task-menu/\">context menu options</a>.</li> </ul>",
            "body_text": "Reduce your users’ admin load with the Task Board’s inviting and intuitive interactions: Verify changes with confirmation dialogs Auto-scroll to any swimlane or column for easy navigation. Edit tasks directly with inline editing , or use the task editor and context menu options .",
            "links": [
