            "modifiers": ["video-file", "reverse", "added-shadow"],
            "heading": "Looks Great In Any Screen Size",
            "body_html": "<p>Responsiveness is built into the core of the Task Board. Filter out unimportant columns to focus on the relevant details on small screens.</p>",
            "body_text": "Responsiveness is built into the core of the Task Board. Filter out unimportant columns to focus on the relevant details on small screens.",
